{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002625","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002625"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002625","label":"晉景公（韓世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"晉景公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","c-shiji-045-han:m004-0000","c-shiji-045-han:m036-0009"]},{"surface":"景公","mention_ids":["c-shiji-045-han:m003-0000","c-shiji-045-han:m004-0035","c-shiji-045-han:m004-0038"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","quote":"晉景公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","quote":"晉景公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m036-0009","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p036","quote":"晉景公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m003-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p003","quote":"景公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0035","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","quote":"景公"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0038","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","quote":"景公"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p003","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m004-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m036-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002625","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p036","chapter_id":"c-shiji-045-han"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji045-003","person_id":"cbr-p002625","surfaces":["晉景公","景公"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-045-han"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","quote":"韓厥，晉景公之三年，晉司寇屠岸賈將作亂，誅靈公之賊趙盾。趙盾已死矣，欲誅其子趙朔。韓厥止賈，賈不聽。厥告趙朔令亡。朔曰：「子必能不絶趙祀，死不恨矣。」韓厥許之。及賈誅趙氏，厥稱疾不出。程嬰、公孫杵臼之藏趙孤趙武也，厥知之。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p003","quote":"景公十一年，厥與郤克將兵八百乘伐齊，敗齊頃公于鞍，獲逢丑父。於是晉作六卿，而韓厥在一卿之位，號爲獻子。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p004","quote":"晉景公十七年，病，卜大業之不遂者爲祟。韓厥稱趙成季之功，今後無祀，以感景公。景公問曰：「尚有世乎？」厥於是言趙武，而復與故趙氏田邑，續趙氏祀。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-045-han:p036","quote":"太史公曰：韓厥之感晉景公，紹趙孤之子武，以成程嬰、公孫杵臼之義，此天下之陰德也。韓氏之功，於晉未睹其大者也。然與趙、魏終爲諸侯十餘世，宜乎哉！"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、號稱、是為與連續敘事；兩位韓武子、韓趙簡子、韓魏文侯及不同時段未名楚王分開。原字及韓姬弒悼公、蟣蝨等疑點不訂正；裸王與回敘指代留待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:p002","text":"韓厥，晉景公之三年，晉司寇屠岸賈將作亂，誅靈公之賊趙盾。趙盾已死矣，欲誅其子趙朔。韓厥止賈，賈不聽。厥告趙朔令亡。朔曰：「子必能不絶趙祀，死不恨矣。」韓厥許之。及賈誅趙氏，厥稱疾不出。程嬰、公孫杵臼之藏趙孤趙武也，厥知之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"韓厥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002624","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-045-han:m002-0003","start":3,"en